    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>===Game Description===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and gather building blocks...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the collected blocks and recipes to craft vehicles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An action game of running, jumping, and crafting.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While riding a vehicle, you'll earn increased scores and be able to defeat enemies and obstacles!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft a variety of vehicles, dash through stages, and earn high scores in one go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>===Controls===</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbJump: Left-click<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 SPACE on the keyboard<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0XInput Controller: A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbDouble Jump: Left-click while jumping <br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0SPACE on the keyboard<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0XInput Controller: A</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCraft: Right-click<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 SHIFT on the keyboard<br>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 XInput Controller: RB</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bThe &quot;CRAFT!&quot; button at the bottom left also acts as a gauge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u3000Crafting is possible when it glows yellow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>===Game Tips===</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbStars give 10 points, while building blocks and recipes provide 50 points each.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRiding a vehicle allows you to defeat enemies and obstacles while earning scores!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBe careful not to fall through cracked floors during jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEach vehicle has its own unique features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCars increase the score gained from collecting blocks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTrains increase the score obtained from defeating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRockets enhance the score earned and the number of jumps available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb??? has its own set of features...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bI apologize if there are any mistakes as I am using a translation tool.</p>",
