racked floors during jumps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbEach vehicle has its own unique features!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbCars increase the score gained from collecting blocks, and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbTrains increase the score obtained from defeating enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbRockets enhance the score earned and the number of jumps available.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fb??? has its own set of features...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u203bI apologize if there are any mistakes as I am using a translation tool.</p>",
